1
00:00:06,548 --> 00:00:07,716
What are you thinking?

2
00:00:07,882 --> 00:00:09,009
I was thinking

3
00:00:09,009 --> 00:00:09,926
about our game.

4
00:00:09,926 --> 00:00:10,926
Yeah?

5
00:00:11,052 --> 00:00:12,052
So it's nothing.

6
00:00:13,013 --> 00:00:15,133
You looked serious, so I
thought something went wrong.

7
00:00:15,265 --> 00:00:16,349
Nothing serious.

8
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,518
Really, it is nothing.

9
00:00:19,269 --> 00:00:20,269
Yeah.

10
00:00:21,146 --> 00:00:22,146
But

11
00:00:22,897 --> 00:00:23,648
it was fun, right?

12
00:00:23,815 --> 00:00:24,232
Yeah.

13
00:00:24,649 --> 00:00:25,817
It was really fun.

14
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:27,944
My shoulders were light

15
00:00:28,278 --> 00:00:29,612
I threw breaking balls right

16
00:00:30,864 --> 00:00:32,741
and other guys did not
make mistakes defending.

17
00:00:33,241 --> 00:00:34,241
We also scored

18
00:00:34,868 --> 00:00:35,869
quite a lot too.

19
00:00:36,369 --> 00:00:37,495
Our opponent was strong.

20
00:00:40,457 --> 00:00:41,457
Do you have any regret?

21
00:00:43,543 --> 00:00:44,543
No.

22
00:00:45,295 --> 00:00:47,047
It was the most fun
I've ever had

23
00:00:47,547 --> 00:00:49,758
playing baseball.

24
00:00:51,384 --> 00:00:53,011
It's a shame

25
00:00:53,136 --> 00:00:54,971
that I won't
able to play baseball

26
00:00:55,722 --> 00:00:56,722
like this one.

27
00:00:58,141 --> 00:00:59,141
Yeah.

28
00:01:01,603 --> 00:01:02,896
What is your plan from now on?

29
00:01:03,396 --> 00:01:04,925
Do you want to
keep playing baseball?

30
00:01:05,105 --> 00:01:06,149
Oh.

31
00:01:06,649 --> 00:01:08,449
I would like to focus
on rehabilitation first.

32
00:01:08,526 --> 00:01:09,526
I have plenty of time.

33
00:01:10,820 --> 00:01:11,404
What about you?

34
00:01:11,654 --> 00:01:13,615
I just loved playing
baseball with you guys

35
00:01:13,948 --> 00:01:15,408
so if I can't play
baseball with you

36
00:01:16,076 --> 00:01:17,744
I don't think I'd
want to play anymore.

37
00:01:20,622 --> 00:01:21,622
Yeah.

38
00:01:24,167 --> 00:01:25,167
Guys, big news!

39
00:01:25,251 --> 00:01:27,712
The Principal says
the baseball club will stay!
